{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳一段車Cam片段，直擊一名男子在大圍車公廟站附近的行車道上操控電動輪椅。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-10-12h31m32s096.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026ZA37LSjSwE1786336886.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-10-12h31m32s096.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">影片中所見，當時該路段正值交通擠塞，一名身穿白色上衣的阿伯操控電動輪椅駛入車道，並在車輛之間的縫隙前行，片主指出，當時在塞車期間突然看到電動輪椅在路面出現，亦令旁邊的電單車駕駛者受到驚嚇。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-10-12h31m41s613.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026h91ViNQ6Ii1786336900.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-10-12h31m41s613.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片引起熱議，部分網民笑指：「掛返個車牌先啦，阿伯」、「自駕遊」，同時亦有網民關注電動輪椅在馬路上行駛的安全隱患，表示：「到佢點算？」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T04:59:23.442921+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}